{"scope":"knowledge","page":58,"pageSize":24,"total":1502,"totalPages":63,"items":[{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-3948263c77e2","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"导演阐述工艺：拆分/分镜前的项目级指令","description":"来自对导演阐述如何约束完整生产链的定性案例阅读，示例均为合成改写。导演阐述是 整条流程里影响很大的人工输入：写在拆分/分镜之前，约束全剧后续工作——分镜 格式、摄影职责、节奏方向和已知能力条件。在本套件中，它落入 `short-drama.json#/creator_authority` 中的 `visual_direction` 与 `production_profile`， 由本技能在 `项目开发/director-brief.md` 中起草候选并展示语义差异。创作者接…","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-develop/references/director-brief-craft.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-develop","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-3af0e802c492","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"题材、画风、场景与提示词 Know-how 学习","description":"本流程扩展完整项目链阅读，专门积累“在什么题材承诺、制作形态、视觉方向和场景职责下， 哪种提示词机制可能解决什么问题”。它不做提示词词频、风格代码排行或任务成功率分析。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-knowhow/references/prompt-production-learning.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-knowhow","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-3b407b8465f1","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"节奏曲线系统","description":"每集时长约 1.5–3 分钟，内部节奏遵循三段式：","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["OmniMux-skills-short-dr…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/OmniMux-skills-short-drama-screenwriter/references/rhythm-curve.md","ext":".md","pack":"OmniMux-skills-short-drama-screenwriter","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-4159fa045772","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"从剧本提取资产出现记录","description":"出现记录说明“某段剧本在某处要求了什么”，它不是资产身份本身。先记录出现，再判断 它对应哪个资产，可以避免把同一人物的几套衣服拆成几个人，也能避免把两个同称谓的人 误并成一人。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-assets/references/occurrence-extraction.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-assets","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-44b609dc51df","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"视频提示词阶段契约","description":"本阶段只拥有 `剧集/<EP>/视频提示词.md` 中的 `MOTION-...` 项与按需的时间线音乐章节。它继承镜头 起点、终点、时长、对白和冻结帧，不回写分镜或视觉设定：镜头边界、职责、起终状态和关键帧正文都不在 本阶段手里。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-video-prompts/references/stage-contract.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-video-prompts","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-4541f2f494f5","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"原著分析审查表","description":"`项目开发/source-analysis/` 下由 `$short-drama-novel-analyze` 发布的分析层： `_index.json`、`triage.md`、`chapters/*.md`、`story-units.md`、`rhythm-and-emotion.md`、 `characters.md`、`world.md`、`adaptation-value.md`、`episode-candidates.jsonl`。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-review/references/rubric-source-analysis.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-review","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-45ecf3ae3006","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"机制循环与耗尽","description":"1. 使用方式与规则分级 2. 循环是引擎与分集之间的那一层 3. 写清一次运行 4. 一次运行与一次重复的区别 5. 循环耗尽：症状与根因 6. 换代：先处置，再把紧迫性交过去 7. 一种常见变体：落差型循环 8. 循环与单集契约的关系 9. 合成示例 10. 失败征兆与审查问题","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-develop/references/mechanism-loop.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-develop","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-46ec59f7c32c","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"反派设计体系","description":"微短剧的反派不是\"坏人\"那么简单。反派的质量直接决定了爽点的质量——主角打脸一个路人甲，观众无感；打脸一个嚣张了十集的恶人，观众拍手叫好。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["OmniMux-skills-short-dr…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/OmniMux-skills-short-drama-series-writer/references/villain-design.md","ext":".md","pack":"OmniMux-skills-short-drama-series-writer","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-485684c0c8e5","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"Location / View 设计","description":"陈设阶段、时段、天气、光态。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-assets/references/location-and-view.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-assets","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-4becb52f096a","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"摄影机、环境声音与只读连续性","description":"transition 将两段分开。 production profile 继承的 `taste_option`。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-video-prompts/references/camera-audio-continuity.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-video-prompts","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-4d78876afaec","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"爽点矩阵","description":"观众看微短剧的核心诉求就是\"爽\"。爽点设计得好，观众欲罢不能；设计得差，观众昏昏欲睡。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/short-drama/references/satisfaction-matrix.md","ext":".md","pack":"short-drama","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-5035d0f0b9d6","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"人物设定图与 Look Variant","description":"人物设定图必须始终可识别为同一个 accepted identity，同时只呈现一套自洽 Look。不要把互不兼容的服装、发型、伤势、年龄或风化状态平均成一个合成人。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-image-prompts/references/character-and-look.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-image-prompts","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-51620f9009d6","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"场次级声音戏剧设计","description":"剧本阶段只写**故事需要听见、撤掉或留白的声音事实**，不替逐镜提示词做混音。声音要改变观众 注意、空间感或人物压力，而不是每场复制一份环境音清单。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-write/references/scene-sound-dramaturgy.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-write","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-56ce041c26a3","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"观众此刻可以知道什么","description":"背影、门缝、画外声、浅景深和遮挡会决定观众何时知道一个人是谁、看见证据或发现门后有人。 需要同时防两种错：该给的信息被漂亮构图挡住；不该给的信息被镜头提前泄露。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama/references/audience-reveal.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-5888aaaa5e0b","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"资产拆解审查清单","description":"资产设定完成前，每个下游引用都要解析到明确的身份条目，且变体必须在引用的剧情范围内有效。 未解决的出现项继续保持未决；不得为了让提示词或分镜继续工作，猜一个看似合理的 ID。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-assets/references/asset-review-checklist.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-assets","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-58a343f796e0","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"声音方向","description":"`voice_direction` 是 Character 记录的一部分（`AST-07`），跨集稳定。本场怎么说属于表演， 由 `$short-drama-write` 的配音本逐句决定。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-assets/references/voice-direction.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-assets","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-58e8fb5b8c78","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"题材指南","description":"短剧的差异化竞争力来自题材叠加。规则：","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/short-drama/references/genre-guide.md","ext":".md","pack":"short-drama","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-5948c1a26d7d","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"剧集类型 → 音乐风格映射","description":"根据影视剧类型推荐适配的音乐风格、乐器和人声方向。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["OmniMux-skills-drama-so…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/OmniMux-skills-drama-soundtrack/references/genre-music-mapping.md","ext":".md","pack":"OmniMux-skills-drama-soundtrack","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-5a2803b603d6","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"Frozen Keyframe Craft","description":"Character/Look, Location/View, and Prop/State variants visible there. camera movement, and transforming weather belong to motion, not the keyframe.","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-storyboard/references/keyframe-craft.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-storyboard","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-5c7486631c20","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"内容合规自检清单","description":"微短剧审核趋严，一旦触碰红线，整部剧可能下架甚至连累平台账号。合规不是创作的敌人，而是护栏——在护栏内把故事讲好，才是真本事。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["OmniMux-skills-short-dr…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/OmniMux-skills-short-drama-series-writer/references/compliance-checklist.md","ext":".md",